OL,3,CManhunt for 'violent offender'
OL,4,Claunched after a woman was sexually
OL,5,Cassaulted
OL,7,FA manhunt for a 'violent offender' has
OL,8,Fbeen launched after a woman was
OL,9,Fsexually assaulted in southwest London.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Meadowsweet
OL,12,FClose, West Barnes, shortly before
OL,13,Fmidnight on Thursday (August 6th)
OL,14,Fafter the 'serious' incident.
OL,16,FA larger police presence remains
OL,17,Fvisible in the area. No arrests have
OL,18,Fbeen made.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/4
