OL,3,CManhunt for 'violent offender'
OL,4,Claunched after a woman was sexually
OL,5,Cassaulted
OL,7,FDCI Rebecca Roberts, who is leading
OL,8,Fthe investigation said: "My teams are
OL,9,Fdoing all they can to identify and
OL,10,Fapprehend this violent offender.
OL,12,F"We are seeking to identify a man
OL,13,Fdescribed as being approximately 5ft
OL,14,F9", approximate age 30, with brown,
OL,15,Fmedium to long hair and brown eyes.
OL,17,F"He was wearing jeans, a belt with a
OL,18,Fgold belt buckle, black trainers, and
OL,19,Fa black padded coat.
OL,26,@pD@YOUvD@BO]
