OL,3,CManhunt for 'violent offender'
OL,4,Claunched after a woman was sexually
OL,5,Cassaulted
OL,7,F"He was described as speaking with an
OL,8,Faccent and could be of West Asian or
OL,9,FEastern European heritage.
OL,11,F"The man was wearing a white helmet
OL,12,Fand was riding a pedal assisted e-bike
OL,13,Fwith a green/black delivery box on the
OL,14,Frear.
OL,16,F"I would encourage anyone who
OL,17,Fremembers seeing anything out of the
OL,18,Fordinary near Meadowsweet Close or the
OL,19,Fnearby playing fields to come forward
OL,20,Fto police."
OL,26,@sD@AOU
